    <p class="reveal" style="font-size:1.1em;opacity:0.85;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.5em;">The Qigong taught here is high-precision energy work rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine. It requires the Yi to actively guide the energy and the Shen to listen to it. Without that internal connection, the movements are empty shells.</p>
    <p class="reveal" style="font-size:1.1em;opacity:0.85;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 2em;">Where the popular versions of Qigong have grown vague, this teaching stays specific.</p>
